{"seq":1,"slug":"dependency-security","title":"依赖安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security/supply-chain-security/dependency-security","wordCount":628,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖安全\">依赖安全</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>现代前端项目平均依赖数百甚至数千个第三方 npm 包，这些依赖构成了一个庞大的供应链。依赖安全是前端安全中日益重要的领域——一个流行库的漏洞可能影响数百万项目，一个被入侵的包维护者账号可能向整个生态系统注入恶意代码。2021 年的 ua-parser-js 事件和 2022 年的 node-ipc 事件都证明了供应链攻击的破坏力。</p>\n<p>依赖安全管理涵盖三个维度：已知漏洞的检测与修复、依赖更新的安全策略、以及对恶意包的防范。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[依赖安全威胁] --&gt; B[已知漏洞]&#10;    A --&gt; C[恶意包]&#10;    A --&gt; D[依赖混淆]&#10;    A --&gt; E[维护者劫持]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[CVE 数据库匹配]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Typosquatting]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[后门注入]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[公私注册表混淆]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[账号泄露]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[社会工程]\">graph TD\n    A[依赖安全威胁] --&gt; B[已知漏洞]\n    A --&gt; C[恶意包]\n    A --&gt; D[依赖混淆]\n    A --&gt; E[维护者劫持]\n    B --&gt; B1[CVE 数据库匹配]\n    C --&gt; C1[Typosquatting]\n    C --&gt; C2[后门注入]\n    D --&gt; D1[公私注册表混淆]\n    E --&gt; E1[账号泄露]\n    E --&gt; E2[社会工程]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁类型</th>\n<th>攻击方式</th>\n<th>检测手段</th>\n<th>防御措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>已知漏洞</td>\n<td>利用公开的 CVE</td>\n<td>npm audit / Snyk</td>\n<td>及时更新补丁版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Typosquatting</td>\n<td>发布相似名称的恶意包</td>\n<td>人工审查</td>\n<td>复制粘贴包名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖混淆</td>\n<td>利用私有包名在公共注册表抢注</td>\n<td>Scope 命名</td>\n<td>使用 @scope 前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恶意代码注入</td>\n<td>入侵维护者账号发布恶意版本</td>\n<td>lockfile 审查</td>\n<td>固定版本 + 审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链投毒</td>\n<td>install 脚本执行恶意代码</td>\n<td>禁用 scripts</td>\n<td>ignore-scripts</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"漏洞扫描与管理\">漏洞扫描与管理</h2><p>漏洞扫描是依赖安全的基础环节：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm audit&#10;npm audit --production&#10;npm audit fix&#10;npm audit fix --force&#10;&#10;npx better-npm-audit audit --level moderate&#10;&#10;npx snyk test&#10;npx snyk monitor\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fix</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> better-npm-audit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> audit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --level</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> moderate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snyk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> snyk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> monitor</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 CI/CD 中集成漏洞扫描：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Security Audit&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 8 * * 1&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  audit:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm audit --audit-level=moderate&#10;      - name: Snyk Security Scan&#10;        uses: snyk/actions/node@master&#10;        env:&#10;          SNYK_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.SNYK_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Security Audit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 8 * * 1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm audit --audit-level=moderate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Snyk Security Scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">snyk/actions/node@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          SNYK_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.SNYK_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DependencyPolicy {&#10;  maxAge: number;&#10;  allowedLicenses: string[];&#10;  bannedPackages: string[];&#10;  requireLockfile: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const defaultPolicy: DependencyPolicy = {&#10;  maxAge: 365,&#10;  allowedLicenses: [&#39;MIT&#39;, &#39;Apache-2.0&#39;, &#39;BSD-2-Clause&#39;, &#39;BSD-3-Clause&#39;, &#39;ISC&#39;],&#10;  bannedPackages: [&#39;event-stream&#39;, &#39;flatmap-stream&#39;, &#39;ua-parser-js@0.7.29&#39;],&#10;  requireLockfile: true,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxAge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  allowedLicenses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bannedPackages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requireLockfile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> defaultPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DependencyPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxAge: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  allowedLicenses: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Apache-2.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BSD-2-Clause'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BSD-3-Clause'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ISC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bannedPackages: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'event-stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flatmap-stream'</span><span style=\"color:#24292